{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>國際人氣 DJ 坐鎮 ✕ 3 大主題變裝派對</p><p>今次活動請嚟韓國人氣 DJ Varo、DJ Hermit、泰國 DJ 22Bullets 同本地 DJ Delta T 等輪流接力打碟；三個週末仲分別以「熱爆動漫」、「電影狂想曲」同「萬聖節電音大派對」為主題，最啱約埋一班朋友仔一齊变裝打卡，喺微風同強勁節拍下享受夜色！</p><p>懷舊尖東霓虹招牌 ✕ 關智斌原創 IP</p><p>現場特別向尖東傳統街景致敬，打造咗極有懷舊情懷嘅「萬聖霓虹打卡裝置」；同場仲有本地藝人關智斌（Kenny）親自設計嘅 IP 角色「米丸」同「肉丸」首度登場，搞怪造型配埋復古霓虹燈，視覺效果超豐富～</p><p>鬼馬小食市集 ✕ 歡樂大使請飲特飲</p><p>派對隔離設有特色市集，將傳統「一盅兩件」點心變成搞鬼造型，亦有變裝同面部彩繪攤位；尖東美食里仲會有歡樂大使穿梭海畔酒吧，免費請現場朋友飲特飲！下午時段亦設有親子嘉年華同兒童 Beatbox 表演，無論係同朋友去 Party 定帶小朋友放電都好適合。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179215922325824998_18832668776ad22df77baf6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179215922483681871_13553916306ad22dfab652d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179215922762422438_21082787166ad22dfbddf50.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179215922927116757_18728846886ad22dfd7cf24.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179215923044836412_14518879586ad22dfeef1e3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1792159232076926_17717470366ad22e00563ca.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:20:30.040112+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":491,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T22:37:52.969038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:40.188324+00:00","content_hash":"2439a5d51768d4778ffbec6a458842bb903a22d8dbb869d729e3609ba558425d","evidenc